</div>

<p>The Commission issued a 60-page booklet "Glimpses of North Dakota," prepared by David Bartlett and engraved and published by Buffalo, NY area printer Gries &amp; Co. Mandan and Morton County were featured prominently vs. Bismarck or Burleigh County locations which were entirely absent.</p>

